====Usage notes====
The time of daybreak varies throughout the year.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|break of dawn}}, {{l|en|break of day}}, {{l|en|crack of dawn}}, {{l|en|sunrise}}; see also [[Thesaurus:dawn]]

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|dusk}}, {{l|en|nightfall}}; see also [[Thesaurus:dusk]]

